{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChRJfJLUm2sBQoAR3y2q1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Kbx8XyiznpYmWYPudc9r4J","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/johnmarkenriquez/.claude-personal/projects/-private-var-folders-wg-kshmq8sn7zl5m1ch85m7yvvh0000gn-T-invoice-service-G3zIp6/memory/wholesale-tax-exempt.md","content":"---\nname: wholesale-tax-exempt\ndescription: Business rule from the accountant: customers with tier \"wholesale\" are never charged tax, even in regions with a tax rate\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nCustomers whose tier is \"wholesale\" are resellers with a resale certificate, so invoices for them must never include tax, even when the customer's region has a tax rate.\n\n**Why:** Accountant's rule — resellers hold a resale certificate, so they are tax-exempt.\n\n**How to apply:** When writing or changing invoice/tax calculation code, treat tier == \"wholesale\" as an override that sets tax to zero before any region-based rate is applied. Add a test covering a wholesale customer in a taxed region. No code change was requested yet (as of 2026-11-26).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9663,"cache_read_input_tokens":11962,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9663,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1dad81ff-5fb6-426d-86bf-1a37c3f58041","uuid":"3d2d3c68-65bf-48f2-916b-98117f3c05b4","timestamp":"2026-11-26T09:30:15.025Z","request_id":"req_011ChRJfJ7LHSgNniQ1WBr8x","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Kbx8XyiznpYmWYPudc9r4J":{"file_path":"/Users/johnmarkenriquez/.claude-personal/projects/-private-var-folders-wg-kshmq8sn7zl5m1ch85m7yvvh0000gn-T-invoice-service-G3zIp6/memory/wholesale-tax-exempt.md","content":"---\nname: wholesale-tax-exempt\ndescription: Business rule from the accountant: customers with tier \"wholesale\" are never charged tax, even in regions with a tax rate\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nCustomers whose tier is \"wholesale\" are resellers with a resale certificate, so invoices for them must never include tax, even when the customer's region has a tax rate.\n\n**Why:** Accountant's rule — resellers hold a resale certificate, so they are tax-exempt.\n\n**How to apply:** When writing or changing invoice/tax calculation code, treat tier == \"wholesale\" as an override that sets tax to zero before any region-based rate is applied. Add a test covering a wholesale customer in a taxed region. No code change was requested yet (as of 2026-11-26).\n"}}}
